{
  "abstract": "Formalization of the principal mathematical results of Heng Li and Xizhi Liu, Unbounded GHZ dimension from fixed-order multiphoton sources. The current registration scope consists of three configurations selecting 20 theorems: quantitative rigid-hypergraph growth and prescribed dimension, harmonic and logarithmic upper bounds, the finite extrema f_3(9)=13, f_3(6)=10 and g_3(3)=6 with balanced uniqueness, and the connection to coherent source amplitudes, exact photon-number postselection, normalized GHZ states and optimal equal-weight success probability. Additional compiled supplementary families, finite seeds and threshold proofs are retained as an optional extension outside this registration scope. COVERAGE_AUDIT.md records exact coverage and alternative proofs; each selected Comparator configuration fixes its recorded declarations.",
